title: secret_exists() reports false on 403 permission denied
updated: 2026-09-10T03:37:55Z
---

secret_exists evals the metadata read and treats any exception as "no". A caller whose policy forbids the path is told the secret does not exist. Vault/OpenBao deliberately answer 403 for paths that do exist. Decide whether to let 403 propagate or return a tri-state; either way document it in the POD. Consumers (goldmine, hiplatform) branch on this.
